From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lucaszhongsj <lucaszhongsj@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:58:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ios: the pad's own geometry, a triple tap to the touch layout

The pad lays itself out in the band the panel leaves, a triple tap on the
bottom bar switches to Tap, the gear fades in every touch layout, and the
bar's hint says so once. The 3D layout forwards the touches no control
takes when the profile asks.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: the pad lays itself out in the band the panel leaves, a triple tap switches to Tap, and the gear fades
Issue: none yet: no upstream issue for the companion

